        "en": "Supportive and patient training staff"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Dog parents consistently praise the knowledgeable and encouraging trainers at Believe in Dog, including Valerie, Jae, Alyssa, and Megan. Reviewers note that instructors give personal attention in every class, answer questions patiently, and guide owners with clear guidance. The warm and positive atmosphere helps both dogs and handlers build genuine confidence."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 24,
      "title": {
        "en": "Noticeable behavioral and skill progress"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients highlight transformative results across puppy foundation courses, basic manners, agility fitness, and specialized Reactive Rover classes. Reviewers observe rapid improvements in impulse control, leash walking, and focus around distractions. Pet parents value the practical training tools that enable sustained progress at home."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 24,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle positive reinforcement training methods"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Owners appreciate that all curriculum relies strictly on positive reinforcement without harsh corrections or stressful methods. Dogs are described as visibly excited to arrive for classes and puppy day school. Reviewers especially commend the gentle socialization techniques used for nervous, fearful, or reactive dogs."
      }
    }
  ],
